@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status README · 安装：需要一个 web surface profile（`dsh web` 的默认 profile 名是 `web`）。`git` 和 `pnpm`
都要在 `PATH` 上。

```sh

@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status README · 或安装已发布到 npm 的版本：dsh plugin --profile web add @my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status
```

包声明了 `dsh.bundle`，安装后自动加入 profile 的 bundle 层栈，重启 DSH 生效。

@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status README · 界面：设计过程留档在 `spec.md`、`directions.md`、`direction-approved.md`，三方向初稿与截图在
`design-demos/`（`thumbs.html` 六格候选、`dir-1/2/3.html` 三个完整方向、`index.html`
并排对比）。最终采用的是方向 C：按连接状态分组，而不是按名字排序。

@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status README · 它是怎么工作的：**一条兼容路径。** 如果某个行在 profile 里仍是启用状态，面板会如实显示为「已连接（由该行
自己维护）」。想让它回到「启动时不连」，关闭开关即可——那条路径会走 Plugin Manager 把
`disabled: true` 持久化进 profile。这是面板唯一会写配置的地方，而且只在你明确关它时发生。

@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status README · dsh-mcp-status：English | [中文](README.md)

An MCP connection panel for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness).

It adds a button to the toolbar below the message composer that lists every MCP server configured on this machine and switches each connection on or off. **Nothing is stored: every start begins with everything disconnected**, and you open the few servers this run needs. Quit DSH and they all close; the next start begins from zero again.

@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status README · Or from npm once published：dsh plugin --profile web add @my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status
```

The package declares `dsh.bundle`, so installing it joins the profile's bundle layer stack automatically; restart DSH to take effect.

@my-dsh/dsh-mcp-status README · Host routes：Both live on the authenticated `/api` channel; the client calls them with a same-origin `fetch('api/...')`.

- `GET api/mcp-status.list` → `{ servers: [{ entryId, serverName, transport, target, enabled, connected, phase, tools, managedBy, editable }] }`
- `POST api/mcp-status.set` `{ entryId, enabled }` → `{ ok, application, status }`; on a failed connection `{ ok: false, reason: 'connect-failed', diagnostic }`
